+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: value of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvcm40": the content mapping as the video has it; translated in Estuary (#32252)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#40962"
+msgid "As in the video"
+msgstr ""
+
+#. Hades: value of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvcm40": the default v4.0 part added where there is none; translated in Estuary (#32253)
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+msgctxt "#40963"
+msgid "Add v4.0 where the video has none"
